flowchart LR
  RV["Repository version<br/>tuple of revisions"] --> EVD["Evidence"]
  EVD --> ASR["Assertion"]
  ASR --> UV["Understanding version"]
  UV --> OBL["Coverage obligation"]
  UV --> SC["Scenario"]
  OBL -.satisfied by.-> SC
  SC --> TC["Test case"]
  TC --> DR["Data requirement"]
  TC --> AS["Automation specification"]
  AS --> AB["Automation binding"]
  AB --> EX["Execution attempt"]
  EX --> TR["Triage"]
  TR --> FI["Finding"]
  FI -.becomes new evidence.-> EVD

